  "derivation_rules": [
    "Journey route adjacency is derived from frozen-baseline.json; this file does not duplicate the 93 registry route edges.",
    "Semantic definitions remain owned by semantic-core.json; Stage 3 only references their stable IDs.",
    "Contexts carry identity/meaning across handoffs; navigation itself never manufactures a domain mutation.",
    "A journey may render or route through a semantic object without owning its mutation operation.",
    "Cross-cutting Journey 28 coordinates recovery but never becomes the owner of the recovered domain result.",
    "Gate integration status is independent of Golden/design approval status."
  ],
